<title>SINGAPORE: Shell wins July Nepal kero tender at $195/t-source.</title>
<headline>Shell wins July Nepal kero tender at $195/t-source.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Nepal Oil Corp (NOC) has awarded a tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of superior kerosene oil to Shell Singapore at just under $195 per tonne cost-and-freight (c-and-f) Indian east coast, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender for July 21-31 delivery closed on June 24 and offers were valid until June 26.</p>
<p>In its last tender, NOC bought one cargo for July 1-10 delivery at $199.37 per tonne c-and-f Indian east coast from Dutch trader Vitol, they said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3093)</p>
